OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment told to pay for extra
OL,4,Aasylum site policing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe extra policing costs of a plan to
OL,7,Fhouse more than a thousand asylum
OL,8,Fseekers on Ministry of Defence (MoD)
OL,9,Fland should be covered by the
OL,10,Fgovernment, a police boss has said.
OL,12,FEarlier this year, the Home Office
OL,13,Fannounced a proposal to house 1,256 men
OL,14,Fat MoD Bicester, which it said would
OL,15,Fbring the system "back under control".
OL,17,FThames Valley Police and Crime
OL,18,FCommissioner Matthew Barber said if the
OL,19,Fplan were approved the government
OL,20,Fshould foot bill for additional
OL,21,Fpolicing required around the site.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
